Licenses of this repository

The repository holds code written by the authors, results and derived data
that the authors computed, and short excerpts of third-party sources. Each
part is licensed as stated below. The third-party datasets that the fetch
scripts download are not part of the repository. They keep their own
licenses, which data/<analysis>/SOURCES.md and data/<analysis>/raw/manifest.json
record for each file.


